{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.950000762939453,"text":"Honestly, everyone's been stopping me about this bag all day. This is the Meridian from Volanta. It's all pepled leather with silver hardware, there's no logo on it anywhere, and my laptop actually sits flat inside it. The dress is Zimmerman, the hat is Janessa Leone, and the shoes are Aquazera. The rings are David Yerman, and this little one was my grandmother's. Everyone assumes I paid way more for it than I did, which I kind of love.","words":[{"word":"Honestly","start":0.0,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"everyone's","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"been","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"stopping","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.200000047683716},{"word":"me","start":2.200000047683716,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"about","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"this","start":2.680000066757202,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"bag","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":3.2200000286102295},{"word":"all","start":3.2200000286102295,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"day","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.940000057220459},{"word":"This","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"is","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"the","start":4.760000228881836,"end":5.0},{"word":"Meridian","start":5.0,"end":5.320000171661377},{"word":"from","start":5.320000171661377,"end":5.78000020980835},{"word":"Volanta","start":5.78000020980835,"end":6.179999828338623},{"word":"It's","start":6.800000190734863,"end":7.019999980926514},{"word":"all","start":7.019999980926514,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"pepled","start":7.519999980926514,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"leather","start":7.659999847412109,"end":8.0},{"word":"with","start":8.0,"end":8.4399995803833},{"word":"silver","start":8.4399995803833,"end":8.739999771118164},{"word":"hardware","start":8.739999771118164,"end":9.140000